WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.600
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:09.500
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:06.700
The village is back above ground!

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:07.510
Yeah.

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:11.970
They were all living underground in hiding before.

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:15.000
Now that they're free from
the threat of the Shadow Lord,

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.600
it seems that they can finally see sunlight again.

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:21.000
Raladin sure has changed, hasn't it?

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:24.480
It's been a while, Lief!

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:26.600
Manus!

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:37.900
Is Raladin back to the way it used to be?

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:39.500
It is, thanks to you.

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:44.250
Everyone is relieved to not have
to hide underground anymore.

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:46.700
As you can see,

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:50.700
we're building the foundations today, so things are going to get busy.

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:53.300
Hey, what's that over there?

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:56.760
A lot of people are lining up.

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:58.900
Is it some kind of shop?

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:01.400
It seems to be doing very well.

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:04.300
That's the star reading fortune teller's shop.

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:05.980
Star reading fortune teller?

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:07.700
Is it accurate?

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:10.500
Well I've never been there, so I don't know,

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:13.240
but it's really popular as of late.

00:03:15.300 --> 00:03:18.400
Jasmine, are you interested in fortune telling?

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:20.600
N-Not really...

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:23.900
By the way Lief, what's your business here today?

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:27.000
Did you have something important to do here?

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:28.300
Yeah...

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.510
Actually,

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:36.100
So there are still Ols that remain...

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:38.900
The Shadow Lord has been banished,

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:42.900
but his influence still lingers in the kingdom.

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:46.300
Even though we were supposed
to have finally restored peace...

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:51.800
That's why I want to do anything
I can to establish true peace,

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:54.300
so we decided to begin a new journey.

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:58.800
If I were to stay in the palace, I feel
like most things would slip by me.

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:00.880
So that's how it is...

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:03.250
Lief.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.400
There's something I want to show you three.

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:08.000
Won't you come with me?

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:10.510
Something to show us...?

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:28.800
This is...

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:29.980
Let's go.

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:43.900
Manus, I feel like we've gone down really far...

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:45.500
We're almost there.

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:56.900
This place is...

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:02.100
This is the underground village that everyone
was hiding in when we last came, right?

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:03.300
That's right.

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:04.200
Let's go.

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:13.500
Nobody lives down here anymore, I'm assuming?

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:14.700
That's right.

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:18.700
What was that?

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:20.600
That's the sound of construction work.

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:22.000
Construction?

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:26.000
Is this underground village being demolished?

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:28.580
No, it's quite the opposite.

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:38.400
Look at that...!

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:45.100
We're building this just in case.

00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:46.390
Just in case?

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:51.020
The Shadow Lord still hasn't given up on Deltora.

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:55.900
With this, even if endless
disasters were to strike Deltora,

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:59.000
we would be able to shelter a
great number of people, right?

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:01.820
Manus...

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:08.300
So the people of Raladin, even in times of peace,

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:11.400
are still conscious of the kingdom's future.

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:14.100
We feel the same way about this as you, Lief.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:17.300
Please call on us anytime you need help!

00:06:17.300 --> 00:06:19.500
Yeah! I will!

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:26.400
This looks delicious!

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:28.520
I don't know what to eat first!

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:34.700
The best thing to do when you're
unsure is ask the stars for guidance.

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:36.100
Who are you?

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:39.000
I am he who conveys the guidance of the stars.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:42.800
The stars?

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:46.700
Are you perhaps the famous
star reading fortune teller?

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:48.100
Indeed!

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:51.200
I am the famous master star reader.

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:55.300
As a special service, I will read
each of your fortunes free of charge.

00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:56.700
Really?

00:06:56.700 --> 00:06:59.050
Girls sure like fortune telling, don't they?

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.200
Behold!

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:17.200
A man wearing a red, pointy hat
is going to appear by that corner.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:21.360
The poor soul. Something
terrible must be in store for him.

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:24.500
Really now?

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.740
Well, we can just watch and find out.

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:30.300
There he is!

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:39.600
Something bad did happen!

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:41.900
Something terrible...

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:45.100
Indeed, it wasn't exactly 'inaccurate',

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:47.200
but how should I put this...

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:49.800
How was it? Amazing, right?

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:52.500
Couldn't this just be coincidence?

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:54.700
W-What are you saying?!

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:56.700
Then, one more time.

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:01.300
I see it!

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:04.800
Great misfortune will befall you immediately!

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:07.700
I'm not going to believe it.

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:09.600
Not my problem.

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:13.400
You should at least be careful, Barda.

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:16.040
Kree?

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:19.600
Hey!

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:21.500
Stop! Stop it, will you!

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:23.000
Great misfortune!

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:24.430
It was spot on!

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:28.300
Barda...

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:30.000
Are you alright?

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:34.700
My star readings are accurate, aren't they?

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:43.110
This place is a bit creepy.

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:49.200
Now, shall we begin by reading
the young lady's fortune?

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:51.600
Huh? I'm going first?

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:54.100
W-Why not read Barda's fortune first?

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:56.080
I've already had enough of this.

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:00.900
Now, young lady.

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:02.800
Hold out your hand.

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:05.800
Place your hand on this.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:21.770
Young lady, you have a
boy that you fancy, correct?

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:24.500
T-That's not...

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:32.300
But you're feeling down because you're
always fighting with him, aren't you?

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:36.600
Oh! But there's no need to worry!

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:38.900
It says that the fog will clear.

00:09:38.900 --> 00:09:40.300
The fog will clear?

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:41.840
That's right.

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:47.550
Just like this, look!

00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:56.400
Between you two lies a bridge called a 'bond'.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:59.200
It's just like this rainbow.

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:01.560
A bond...

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:04.300
I wonder what they're talking about.

00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:06.300
What is he showing her?

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:08.800
It's probably some kind of trick.

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:11.900
It's just the sort of thing
you would find in Tom's shop.

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:14.450
You really are amazing!

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:16.600
I'm impressed!

00:10:16.600 --> 00:10:20.000
Now, what about the young man over there?

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:22.800
Would you like to know what your future holds?

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:25.210
Eh? N-No, I'm...

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:36.000
Um,

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:37.600
what's wrong?

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:39.500
There is nothing.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:41.520
I cannot see your future.

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:42.590
Huh?!

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:45.800
What?! W-What do you mean?!

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:50.280
It means that he may be cursed.

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:51.700
Huh?

00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:57.000
When I can't see a person's future, it usually
means that the person is under an ominous curse.

00:10:57.500 --> 00:10:58.700
No way...

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:00.900
A curse...

00:11:00.900 --> 00:11:02.800
Lief, don't let it bother you.

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:05.900
Yeah, it's just fortune telling after all.

00:11:06.400 --> 00:11:08.700
I shouldn't have done this.

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:12.100
Hey, what you just said... is it really true?

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:14.220
Why of course it is!

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:19.500
However, that is not to say
curses cannot be lifted.

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:20.400
Huh?

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:23.100
Jasmine, that's enough.

00:11:23.100 --> 00:11:24.400
We're leaving.

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:25.400
But...

00:11:25.400 --> 00:11:28.000
Come, let's get some dinner.

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:04.390
What's the matter, Jasmine?

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:06.700
O-Oh, no, it's nothing!

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:10.700
Ah, that's right! I need to feed Kree!

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:15.530
What's going on?

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:20.200
I knew you would come back here.

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:23.000
You want to save that boy, correct?

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:25.580
W-Well, yeah...

00:12:26.900 --> 00:12:28.400
I understand.

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:32.920
I understand how you feel very well.

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:39.600
I also wish I could have seen the future
back then and saved my children.

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:42.430
Who are you?

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:46.400
It's me, Jasmine.

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:48.400
Huh?

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:55.600
You couldn't have forgotten me, could you?

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:56.530
Thaegan!

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:00.200
It's been a while.

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:03.400
Why are you here?! Aren't
you supposed to be dead?

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:06.600
As a sorceress, I possess
the power of resurrection,

00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:08.170
unfortunately for you.

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:14.100
Come, let's save Lief from this curse.

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:16.100
I'll lend a hand!

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:18.100
I can't trust you!

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:21.500
You're a sorceress in the
service of the Shadow Lord!

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:24.310
But I want to help you.

00:13:24.800 --> 00:13:27.200
I have changed.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:30.700
I have resolved to dedicate
my life to helping others now!

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:34.280
I'm sure that is what my
children would have wanted.

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:42.400
Will you believe me?

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:44.830
Okay.

00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:51.900
It's in here.

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:04.800
We're here.

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:07.900
That is the source of Lief's curse.

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:09.560
The source of the curse?

00:14:09.900 --> 00:14:15.070
If you can destroy that mirror,
Lief's curse will be lifted.

00:14:15.800 --> 00:14:19.900
However, no blade can destroy the mirror.

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:25.500
Only the strong will and desire in
your heart to save him will destroy it.

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:36.900
<i>Strong will...</i>

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:40.930
<i>The desire in my heart to save Lief...</i>

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:47.100
What is going on?!

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:50.500
You foolish little girl!

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:53.800
You shall serve as my bait!

00:14:53.800 --> 00:14:56.500
Bait to lure Lief here, that is.

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:57.900
What did you say?!

00:14:57.900 --> 00:15:00.000
You tricked me, Thaegan!

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:05.400
I will send you to your
grave this time without fail!

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:22.300
Where did Jasmine go?

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:24.300
Did she get lost somewhere?

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:28.600
Kree, what's the matter?!

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:34.000
Could it be that you've come
to tell us where Jasmine is?

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:37.200
Alright. Kree, show us the way!

00:15:43.650 --> 00:15:47.600
So Jasmine really did come back here...

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:50.580
But, neither Jasmine nor
that fortune teller are here.

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:52.600
Jasmine...

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:54.700
Lief, take a look at this.

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:00.700
This is...

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:04.200
These stairs probably lead
to the underground village.

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:05.100
Let's go!

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:06.050
Manus.

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:09.400
We will go ahead without you.

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:12.200
I can sense something dangerous.

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:13.560
Lief...

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:16.100
We will be fine.

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:18.400
We've always fought together, after all.

00:16:18.400 --> 00:16:24.500
But, if it seems like we've been gone
too long, then let everyone know.

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:26.600
Understood. Take care.

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:30.000
Jasmine!

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:34.580
Jasmine!

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:34.580
Jasmine!

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:38.200
Jasmine!

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:43.900
If you're looking for the
young lady, she's in here.

00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:45.700
The fortune telling old man!

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:47.300
Why are you here?

00:16:47.300 --> 00:16:48.600
Where's Jasmine?

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:56.400
You see, the young lady wanted
desperately to see your future.

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:58.900
So I brought her here.

00:16:58.900 --> 00:17:03.100
There is a star reading mirror
here that shows the future.

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:05.900
Manus never told us about such a thing!

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:09.910
Of course he wouldn't know
of the mirror's true power.

00:17:10.400 --> 00:17:15.800
For your sake, that girl rushed into
the chamber where the mirror sits.

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:20.100
Lief, this man is far too suspicious. It's a trap!

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:24.880
But, if Jasmine is really in there, we have to go!

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:31.700
Jasmine!

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:33.200
Are you there?

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:35.300
Jasmine!

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:37.400
Jasmine,

00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:38.800
Jasmine!

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:41.800
Jasmine!

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:42.900
Lief!

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:44.780
Jasmine!

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:44.780
Go back!

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:48.400
What?!

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:50.300
What is going on?!

00:17:50.300 --> 00:17:53.000
Lief, that fortune teller is actually...

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:56.500
You completely fell for it!

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:59.000
You trio of idiots!

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:00.500
Thaegan!

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:03.600
Impossible! You should be dead!

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:10.100
I have returned from the dead so
that I may drag you back with me!

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:13.000
She must have been waiting
in Raladin to ambush us!

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:16.900
The Shadow Lord has fled!

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:19.000
Why now, Thaegan?!

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:22.900
My objective is to defeat you.

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:26.500
I will resurrect as many times
as necessary to achieve this.

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:29.780
That is the power of my grudge against you three.

00:18:30.300 --> 00:18:31.900
That's insane!

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:34.530
Lief, I'm sorry.

00:18:36.600 --> 00:18:37.620
I'm sorry.

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:41.900
Now, you three may fall
to the underworld together!

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:49.510
Disappear!

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:52.300
Come on!

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:56.300
Just give up!

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:11.500
Curse you, I won't let you get away!

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:16.600
But why?!

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:21.100
Thaegan's face was so gentle when
she was with her children in death!

00:19:21.100 --> 00:19:24.300
Ultimately, she's still a
servant of the Shadow Lord.

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:25.710
She will never change.

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:30.200
It's a dead end!

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:40.800
The time has finally come.

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:47.000
I'm sure the Shadow Lord will be very
pleased to hear of your defeat by my hand.

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:51.400
Now, prepare yourselves for your true end.

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:10.700
D-Damn you...!

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:12.300
What's happening?

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:14.720
Maybe she ran out of magical energy?

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:18.000
Even though I have them cornered...!

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:21.060
Now that it's come to this...!

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:24.100
A spear?!

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:25.950
What the hell?

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:27.500
She's supposed to be a witch!

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:29.070
Something seems off.

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:30.820
Die!

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:35.600
W-Why?!

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:36.570
Fireballs!

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:38.200
You're not Mama!

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:41.300
You're not our mama!

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:44.300
We won't forgive you for
pretending to be Mama!

00:20:45.400 --> 00:20:48.000
Could it be... those fireballs are...!

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:49.670
They're Thaegan's children!

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:51.700
You're not Mama!

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:54.900
What are you...?!

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:58.800
Ouch, ouch, ouch, ouch!

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:04.900
Hey!

00:21:04.900 --> 00:21:06.800
You're an Ol, aren't you?

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:10.300
You turned yourself into Thaegan
thinking we'd falter in fear?!

00:21:11.100 --> 00:21:12.400
I wonder.

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:19.320
Look! So the fortune telling was also fake!

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:23.700
To disguise yourself as me;
what an outrageous Ol!

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:25.540
You shall be punished!

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:36.900
It's the real Thaegan...

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:39.050
She killed the Ol!

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:40.900
Mama!

00:21:40.100 --> 00:21:40.900
Mama!

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:43.000
See, Mama is really strong!

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:45.700
Thaegan,

00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:46.900
thank you.

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:51.600
To think that I'd end up saving you three.

00:21:51.600 --> 00:21:55.400
Well, do keep an eye out for my impostors.

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:06.580
I'm really sorry.

00:22:08.300 --> 00:22:14.200
Well, I hope you've learned not to so readily
believe in curses and fortune telling.

00:22:14.200 --> 00:22:18.200
But, she did do all that for Lief's sake in the end.

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:28.520
I-It's not really like that!

00:22:36.330 --> 00:22:40.500
Bye-bye, thank you! The memories that we shared

00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:45.590
are like a never-fading diamond

00:22:46.210 --> 00:22:50.590
Non-stop, I'm not going to hit the brakes

00:22:50.590 --> 00:22:55.640
I have to continue making this album

00:22:56.310 --> 00:23:01.020
Three springtimes have passed since then

00:23:01.020 --> 00:23:05.360
but I still remember you

00:23:07.070 --> 00:23:11.780
In this ever-changing city landscape

00:23:12.070 --> 00:23:16.160
I'm going out today, wearing a new pair of shoes

00:23:16.160 --> 00:23:20.250
in search of tomorrow

00:23:20.660 --> 00:23:24.750
In this corner of the world

00:23:24.750 --> 00:23:30.470
it really is a miracle that we met each other

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:34.840
It's great to know that today and tomorrow

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:37.970
we will be seeing each other countless times

00:23:37.970 --> 00:23:40.310
Thank you

00:23:40.390 --> 00:23:44.940
Let's chase after our hopes and dreams

00:23:44.940 --> 00:23:50.780
and with a deep breath, say "good morning" to the sun

00:23:50.940 --> 00:23:56.320
Our hearts feel the time passing by, so hold me tight

00:23:56.320 --> 00:24:00.080
and we can start running towards our next adventure

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:09.120
Filli goes missing in the city of Rithmere!

00:24:09.900 --> 00:24:13.250
The shadow of Mother Brightly
is behind this incident.

00:24:13.600 --> 00:24:14.800
Shit...!

00:24:14.800 --> 00:24:18.840
What are you planning
this time, Mother Brightly?!

00:24:19.700 --> 00:24:20.800
Filli,

00:24:20.800 --> 00:24:23.720
hang in there. We'll definitely save you!

00:24:25.400 --> 00:24:27.590
Next time, 'Filli in Big Trouble?'

00:24:28.860 --> 00:24:34.810
Filli in Big Trouble?

00:24:29.300 --> 00:24:30.560
Huh?

00:24:30.560 --> 00:24:34.810
Mother Brightly, did you lose some weight?

00:24:49.840 --> 00:24:54.970
See you next time
